76
00:12:09,116 --> 00:12:13,536
Let it all out

77
00:12:13,936 --> 00:12:17,896
泣き叫びたくていいんだね
it's okay to want to cry out loud, right?

78
00:12:19,476 --> 00:12:24,456
誰かが描いてた
Someone's painted...

79
00:12:24,976 --> 00:12:29,816
カバンの中 鍵の鼻が揺れる
The key nose in the bag sways.

80
00:12:31,076 --> 00:12:35,816
自分らしさなんて 誰もわからないよ
Nobody knows what "being yourself" is.

81
00:12:36,616 --> 00:12:41,516
長い長い道のりの途中 でなくしたり 拾ったり
Along the long, long road, losing and picking things up,

82
00:12:42,356 --> 00:12:47,356
急に寂しくなって 泣ちゃう日もあるけど
suddenly feeling lonely and crying sometimes,

83
00:12:48,316 --> 00:12:53,096
涙も 痛みも 星に帰ろう
tears and pain too, let's return them to the stars,

84
00:12:53,656 --> 00:12:57,976
星屑を 探そう
let's search for stardust.

85
00:12:58,956 --> 00:13:05,196
小さな蕾よでも 二人でつくるよ 欲しい果物を
Small buds, but let's make the desired fruit together!

86
00:13:11,196 --> 00:13:14,996
強欲に光れ 愛を忘るなよ
Shine greedily, don't forget love.

87
00:13:25,056 --> 00:13:29,576
Let it all out Let it all out

88
00:13:30,236 --> 00:13:35,096
足りないこと だらけだよ ねぇ
it's full of things we lack, isn't it?

89
00:13:36,156 --> 00:13:41,036
足りなくて いいんだね
It's okay to lack them, right?

90
00:13:41,416 --> 00:13:46,076
だから君と 出会えたんだ
That's why I was able to meet you.

91
00:13:47,176 --> 00:13:52,136
確かかなのかなの それが知りたくて
I want to know if that's for sure.

92
00:13:52,556 --> 00:14:00,616
小さな不信感を 胸の下に隠してた
Hiding a small sense of distrust deep in my chest,

93
00:14:01,036 --> 00:14:06,336
強がってついには 二人でつくるよ 欲しい果物を
acting tough, but we'll make the desired fruit together.

94
00:14:11,096 --> 00:14:16,496
強く光れ 愛を忘れぬように
Shine strongly, so as not to forget love,

95
00:14:16,856 --> 00:14:20,496
笑顔の君を 抱き締めていく
holding you tight with a smiling face.

96
00:14:20,796 --> 00:14:24,976
小さな接着剤で ふたりでつくるよ 欲しい果物を
With small adhesive, let's make the desired fruit together!

97
00:14:30,836 --> 00:14:41,096
正しいことが間違っていたらどうすればいい 悲しいことが正しかったら受け入れるだけ
What should we do if right was wrong? If sadness was right, we just accept it.

98
00:14:41,876 --> 00:14:50,056
流しとそう思ってた でも君がしてた 君がいて本当に良かった
I thought I was letting it flow, but you knew, and I'm so glad you were there.

99
00:14:51,496 --> 00:14:56,536
Let it all out Let it all out

100
00:14:57,256 --> 00:15:01,036
足りないこと だらけだよ
it's full of things we lack...

101
00:16:29,190 --> 00:16:36,070
あなたは風のように 目を閉じては行く暮れ
You close your eyes like the wind and walk into the twilight,

102
00:16:37,190 --> 00:16:42,870
何を思っているんだろうか
What is it that you're thinking about?

103
00:16:48,130 --> 00:16:55,370
まぶたを開いていた あなたの目はビー玉の
With your eyelids wide open, your eyes were like marbles,

104
00:16:56,510 --> 00:17:01,690
少しだけ春の匂いがした
And they carried just a hint of spring's scent.

105
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:17,610
晴れぬなら晴れ, 晴れないよされ, 冴えて春のせい
If it won't clear up, make it clear; if it doesn't, that's just the crispness of spring,

106
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:24,490
振りやめば雨でさえ あなたを語る春
Even the rain, once it stops, is a spring that speaks of you,

107
00:17:24,850 --> 00:17:27,330
胸を打つ音よ鳴れ
Resound, the sound that strikes my heart.

108
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:36,270
あの雲も曲がってゆく 遠くまで遠くまで
Those clouds, too, curve away, far, far into the distance,

109
00:17:53,390 --> 00:18:01,390
あなたは晴れ模様に 目を閉じては青色
You close your eyes to the sunny weather in a shade of blue,

110
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:07,490
何か悲しいのだろうか
Is there something sad on your mind?

111
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:20,490
まぶたを開いている あなたの目にビー玉の
With your eyelids wide open, in your eyes like marbles,

112
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:26,150
因果少し 雨の匂いがした
There was a little bit of the scent of rain.

113
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:41,590
泣き出しそうなくそ空よ鳴れ 泣いて雨のせい
Cry out, you trembling sky, and cry—blaming it on the rain,

114
00:18:43,110 --> 00:18:48,610
降りしきる雨でさえ 雲の上では春
Even the pouring rain is spring above the clouds,

115
00:18:52,470 --> 00:19:00,610
地平を打つ音よ鳴れ 絶えず晴れのせいで
Resound, the sound striking the horizon, ceaselessly due to the clear weather,

116
00:19:01,970 --> 00:19:10,450
あの雲も曲がってゆく 遠くまで遠くまで
Those clouds, too, curve away, far, far into the distance,

117
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:34,550
遠い雨草をなびかせ いつしか雲も春のせい
In the distance, rain makes the grass sway, and before long the clouds are also spring's doing,

118
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:46,310
風の音 胸に春のせい 春を待つ
The sound of the wind, spring in our hearts, waiting for spring.

119
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:59,210
晴れぬなら晴れ, 晴れないよされ, 冴えて春のせい
If it won't clear up, make it clear; if it doesn't, that's just the crispness of spring,

120
00:20:02,356 --> 00:20:09,206
晴れ渡る夜空へと あなたを呼ぶ歌を投げ
Throwing a song calling out to you into the clear night sky...

121
00:20:10,236 --> 00:20:18,976
胸を焦がす遥か風
A distant spring breeze scorches my heart.

122
00:20:20,086 --> 00:20:28,206
音に聴く遥らの風 咲くこの歌よ 投げ
The distant winds heard in sound, bloom this song and cast it away...

123
00:20:29,186 --> 00:20:37,566
晴れに晴れ 遥かな叫び 最低春のせい
Clear, so clear, a distant cry, the fault of the lowest spring...

124
00:20:38,186 --> 00:20:48,976
あの雲も超えてゆけ 遠くまで遠くまで
Cross over those clouds too, far, far away...

125
