小さな頃には
Ever since I was little...

127
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:38,400
宝の地図が頭の中に
A treasure map inside my head...

128
00:21:39,180 --> 00:21:45,200
浮かんでいた
Was floating there.

129
00:21:46,100 --> 00:21:52,200
いつでも捜していた
I was always searching for...

130
00:21:52,580 --> 00:21:59,300
奇跡の場所を
That miraculous place.

131
00:22:00,180 --> 00:22:07,200
知らない誰かに 負けないように
So I wouldn't lose to some unknown someone...

132
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:15,200
埃だらけの 毎日に
On these dusty days...

133
00:22:15,580 --> 00:22:21,400
いつか光が
Someday, light will shine...

134
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:28,400
全ての日々に...
Upon all those days...

135
00:22:29,180 --> 00:22:35,600
時には私を 任せるだけで
Sometimes, just entrusting myself...

136
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:42,400
もしもし世界が 変わるのなら
If the world itself is going to change...

137
00:22:43,180 --> 00:22:49,400
何も知らない この私の手に
Into this ignorant hand of mine...

138
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:54,600
連れて行って 想い出が
Lead me onward so our memories...

139
00:23:01,180 --> 00:23:07,400
色褪せないように
Won't fade away...

140
00:23:08,100 --> 00:23:14,400
小さな頃から 歌を歌って
Ever since I was little, I've been singing songs...

141
00:23:15,180 --> 00:23:21,400
胸にある心 温めてた
Warming the heart inside my chest...

142
00:23:22,100 --> 00:23:28,600
みんなで真似した 秘密のメロディ
That secret melody everyone imitated...

143
00:23:29,180 --> 00:23:36,400
今度は同時に 聴こえるように
Now echoing so it can be heard at the same time...

144
00:23:37,100 --> 00:23:43,600
今までは ため息ついて ばかりで
Until now, I've just been sighing away...

145
00:23:44,100 --> 00:23:51,600
誰もまだ 本物の 夢さえ掴めないまま
Without anyone ever grasping a true dream yet...

146
00:23:52,100 --> 00:23:57,600
もしもし時代が 戻るのなら
If times could turn back...

147
00:23:58,100 --> 00:24:04,400
涙を流した この私の手に
Into this hand of mine that shed tears...

