00:54:29,878 --> 00:54:38,438
笑ってて今度は一人で行くんだって
Smiling, this time I will go on all alone...

306
00:55:04,150 --> 00:55:08,770
遠い遠い 忘れない想い
Distant, distant, unforgettable memories...

307
00:55:09,310 --> 00:55:14,850
いつか僕がいなくなったなら
If one day I were to disappear...

308
00:55:15,710 --> 00:55:21,130
深い深い 森に落ちた
I fell deep, deep into the forest.

309
00:55:21,250 --> 00:55:26,750
君はひとりで行くんだぜ
You'll just have to go on all by yourself.

310
00:55:27,170 --> 00:55:32,690
それから一人歩いて一人嘘をつく
From then on, walking alone, telling lies alone...

311
00:55:33,470 --> 00:55:40,610
子供も疲れた宇宙向き一人小金の部屋
Even the child grew tired of facing the universe alone in a room of gold.

312
00:55:45,090 --> 00:55:50,650
君とふたりで行いたんだぜ
I wanted to go with the two of us...

313
00:55:51,410 --> 00:55:56,790
僕は深い森に落ちた
I fell into the deep forest.

314
00:55:57,390 --> 00:56:08,330
黒くすすけて汚れた果実 それで終わりそれだけの話
Blackened, soot-stained, spoiled fruit—that's the end of it, that's all there is to the story.

315
00:56:08,990 --> 00:56:14,690
君はひとりで行くんだぜ
You'll just have to go on all by yourself.

